            <li><strong>Platform:</strong> api.twelvelabs.io/v1.3</li>
            <li><strong>Flagship:</strong> Pegasus 1.5 (multimodal)</li>
            <li><strong>Foundation:</strong> Marengo 3.0 (27B embeddings)</li>
            <li><strong>Index:</strong> $0.042/min one-time</li>
